#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""This PC: Windows File Explorer for DevOS.

Provides the authentic Windows 10/11 File Explorer experience:
- 'This PC' view with Folders (Desktop, Documents, Downloads, Music, Pictures, Videos)
- 'Devices and drives' with Windows drive letters (C:, D:, E:...), drive icons, storage bars
- Seamless in-window navigation across disks and folders (no external dolphin popup)
- Breadcrumb address bar with direct path editing and Windows drive mapping
- Real-time search filter
- Details and Large Icons view modes with Windows file classifications
- Windows context menus, shortcuts, and file operations (New folder, Cut, Copy, Paste, Delete, Rename)
- Quick access sidebar with drives and special folders
- Windows 11 dark theme aesthetics
"""

